   "block": "mm_027"
  },
  {
   "speaker": "user",
   "text": "Can I ask about something else? They'll ask me about a time I handled a challenge, and I've got a few stories but can't pick.",
   "est_sec": 7.85,
   "gap_before": 1.36,
   "block": "job_interview.opt4"
  },
  {
   "speaker": "user",
   "text": "Okay, a handful of options. Listen first, I'll say when I'm finished.",
